        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.404,
            0.748,
            0.47
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "On a bright summer afternoon, Aavi and Thirav enjoy their shikanji (lemonade). After looking at the ice in the lemonade, Thirav wonders about the nature of ice and water."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.086,
            0.528,
            0.273,
            0.653
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_0_image_9.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.298,
            0.507,
            0.502,
            0.655
          ],
          "content": "Ice feels hard to touch and we can hold it in our hands, whereas, water cannot be held in the same way. So, they must be different substances."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.598,
            0.491,
            0.641,
            0.509
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "No,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.537,
            0.509,
            0.704,
            0.546
          ],
          "content": "these are the same substances."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.662,
            0.54,
            0.775,
            0.644
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_0_image_13.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.672,
            0.759,
            0.697
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Aavi has a counterview to Thirav. What do you think? Why?"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.763,
            0.198,
            0.864
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_0_image_15.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.202,
            0.742,
            0.393,
            0.835
          ],
          "content": "water in the freezer of a refrigerator and check if it gets converted into ice."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.457,
            0.728,
            0.675,
            0.857
          ],
          "content": "Yes, I know when water is left in the freezer, it gets converted into ice but probably something gets added to the ice in the freezer."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.696,
            0.756,
            0.873,
            0.88
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_0_image_18.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.882,
            0.673,
            0.906
          ],
          "content": "Do you think Thirav is right? How can you find out?"
        },
